transfolio

Parts of this project are based on transfolio, the Atari Portfolio file
transfer program by Klaus Peichl, (c) 2018 Klaus Peichl
(https://github.com/skudi/transfolio, described at
https://www.pofowiki.de/doku.php?id=software:vorstellung:exchanges:transfolio):

- patches/rpfolio-portfolioserver.patch is a change to transfolio.c;
- the bit- and block-level code in tools/pofoprobe/pofoprobe.c follows
  transfolio.c;
- the description of the ROM server's protocol in docs/protocol.md draws on
  Klaus Peichl's write-up.

Those parts remain the work of Klaus Peichl; the MIT licence in LICENSE covers this
project's own additions. Thanks to Klaus Peichl for transfolio, which made
this project possible.
